msgstr ""

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:232
msgid "`results` returns a copy of the results in the order they were given; `success` is the overall verdict."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:240
msgid "$\\text{total} = \\text{executable} + \\text{unsupported} + \\text{diagnostic}$ and $\\text{executable} = \\text{passed} + \\text{failed}$. `success()` is true when no executable case failed **and** there is no diagnostic case; unsupported cases do not affect it."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:267
