#: manual/conformance/decimal.md:25
msgid "`just gate decimal` runs native, Wasm, Wasm-GC, and JavaScript. LLVM is excluded because the required local artifacts are not part of the repository. Target-specific coefficient dispatch must not change value, encoding, or flags."
