msgstr ""

#: manual/design/ball_float.md:3
msgid "`ball_float` computes with sets of real numbers instead of single approximations. This page states the mathematical contract, derives the formulas the code uses, explains the choices behind them, and lists what the package does not do. The [API reference](../api/ball_float.md) documents each function; the [tutorial](../tutorial/ball_float.md) shows them in use."
