#: manual/design/bench/ball_float.md:62
#: manual/design/bench/bin_float.md:64
#: manual/design/bench/decimal.md:62
#: manual/design/bench/decimal_gda.md:59
msgid "**Random inputs per sample.** They would mix input variance into timing variance; fixed patterns per dataset isolate the cost of the code."
